/E (Meta Facebook currently receives the largest share of the marketing budget and drives the majority of total revenue. However, this channel is approaching its saturation point, with an ROI near 1.0. In contrast, Google Search-based channels show higher ROIs and capture active consumer behaviour rather than passive exposure.)
