/E (To maximize total revenue, it is necessary to shift the focus from high-spend, saturated channels towards under-invested platforms that have not yet reached their saturation threshold. By doing this, the organisation can improve its overall efficiency and optimize the total return on advertising investment without necessarily increasing the available budget.)
