/E (To perform an efficient reallocation of current and future marketing budget, four different investment scenarios are analysed under various strategies. The first scenario focuses on the impact of a 20% increase in total budget, while the second scenario doubles the investment for the most performing channel. Moreover, the third scenario assesses the gains from reducing spending on saturated channels by 30%, whereas the fourth scenario evaluates the effects of a 10% budget increase related to a random half of the channels. These scenarios are compared by considering three allocation strategies: equal allocation, mROI allocation, and saturated channels allocation.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
