/Title (Feature Importance and Comparison The feature importance plot highlights that GOOGLE_SHOPPING_CLICKS is the most significant feature, followed by MONTH and GOOGLE_VIDEO_IMPRESSIONS, suggesting that Google performance is essential for the company. Temporal variables also rank high, as seasonality and recurring patterns play an important role in affecting revenue. Moreover, it is possible to compare SHAP importance from the surrogate model with the actual contribution estimates from the Meridian MMM in order to better understand the performance of media channels. In particular, the SHAP analysis is focused on short-term fluctuations, highlighting Google channels as primary drivers of daily revenue, while the Meridian model better captures the long-term effects of channels like Meta Facebook, which represents the largest investment over the considered period.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 791 0 R
/Next 573 0 R
>>
endobj
