790 0 obj
<<
/Title (Purchasing Trend The dataset covers a period of 821 days, from 15 October 2021 to 13 January 2024, and this plot displays a 7-day moving average to filter out daily noise and show the trends of both revenue and order volume. As expected, the two lines follow a similar path, confirming a direct relationship between the number of orders and total revenue. Moreover, while the daily averages are about $ 36,990 in revenue and 362 orders, the organisation experienced clear seasonal patters. Indeed, there were recurring increases in the final months of the year, which is common in the Food & Drink sector, with daily revenue reaching $ 120,000 across 1,000 orders by the end of 2023.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 717 0 R
/Next 792 0 R
>>
endobj
