/Title (Channel efficiency varies significantly according to how quickly each media platform reaches saturation. In particular, Meta Instagram shows a clear initial increase in revenue even with limited marketing budget, but it also reaches diminishing returns sooner. Instead, other channels like Google Paid Search and Google PMax display a more gradual growth curve, suggesting that they can handle larger investments over time without losing efficiency as quickly.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
